{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"call@18","snapshotName":"after@call@18","pageId":"page@fbb6ab3d884692759f24f95cdb28d26e","frameId":"frame@8aa454ac4df4fd82bf1364cb34908a52","frameUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:3000/register","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"lang":"en"},["HEAD",{},["BASE",{"href":"http://127.0.0.1:3000/register"}],"\n    ",["META",{"charset":"utf-8"}],"\n  ",["META",{"name":"viewport","content":"width=device-width, initial-scale=1"}],"\n  ",["LINK",{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon.ico"}],"\n  ",["TITLE",{},"Secure Gate"],"\n  ",["STYLE",{},"/**\n * Floating Label Input Styles\n * Enhanced input component with animated floating label\n */\n\n/* Wrapper */\n.floating-input-wrapper {\n  width: 100%;\n  margin-bottom: var(--space-md, 16px);\n}\n\n/* Container */\n.floating-input-container {\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  background-color: var(--color-input-bg, #ffffff);\n  border: 2px solid var(--color-border-primary, #e2e8f0);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 12px);\n  transition: all var(--transition-normal, 200ms) var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n  min-height: 56px;\n}\n\n/* Container States */\n.floating-input-container:hover:not(.floating-input--error):not(.floating-input--disabled) {\n  border-color: var(--color-border-secondary, #cbd5e1);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(203, 213, 225, 0.1);\n}\n\n.floating-input--focused {\n  border-color: var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);\n}\n\n.floating-input--error {\n  border-color: var(--color-error-500, #ef4444);\n  background-color: var(--color-error-50, #fef2f2);\n}\n\n.floating-input--success {\n  border-color: var(--color-success-500, #10b981);\n}\n\n.floating-input--disabled {\n  background-color: var(--color-secondary-100, #f1f5f9);\n  border-color: var(--color-border-primary, #e2e8f0);\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n/* Icons */\n.floating-input__icon {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  color: var(--color-text-tertiary, #94a3b8);\n  transition: color var(--transition-fast, 150ms) var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n}\n\n.floating-input__icon--left {\n  padding-left: var(--space-md, 16px);\n  padding-right: var(--space-sm, 8px);\n}\n\n.floating-input__icon--right {\n  padding-left: var(--space-sm, 8px);\n  padding-right: var(--space-md, 16px);\n  min-width: 40px;\n}\n\n.floating-input__icon svg {\n  width: 20px;\n  height: 20px;\n}\n\n.floating-input--focused .floating-input__icon {\n  color: var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n}\n\n/* Status Icons */\n.floating-input__status-icon {\n  width: 20px;\n  height: 20px;\n  animation: statusIconAppear 0.3s var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n}\n\n.floating-input__status-icon--error {\n  color: var(--color-error-500, #ef4444);\n}\n\n.floating-input__status-icon--success {\n  color: var(--color-success-500, #10b981);\n  animation: successPulse 0.6s var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n}\n\n@keyframes statusIconAppear {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scale(0.8);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: scale(1);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes successPulse {\n  0%, 100% {\n    transform: scale(1);\n  }\n  50% {\n    transform: scale(1.1);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Field Container */\n.floating-input__field {\n  position: relative;\n  flex: 1 1;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  min-height: 56px;\n}\n\n/* Input */\n.floating-input__input {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  padding: 24px 16px 8px 16px;\n  border: none;\n  background: transparent;\n  font-size: var(--text-base, 1rem);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary, #0f172a);\n  outline: none;\n  transition: padding var(--transition-normal, 200ms) var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n}\n\n.floating-input__input--with-left-icon {\n  padding-left: 0;\n}\n\n.floating-input__input--with-right-icon {\n  padding-right: 0;\n}\n\n.floating-input__input::placeholder {\n  color: var(--color-text-muted, #64748b);\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: opacity var(--transition-fast, 150ms) var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n}\n\n.floating-input__input:focus::placeholder {\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.floating-input__input:disabled {\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  color: var(--color-text-disabled, #94a3b8);\n}\n\n/* Prevent autofill background */\n.floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill,\n.floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill:hover,\n.floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill:focus {\n  -webkit-box-shadow: 0 0 0 1000px var(--color-input-bg, #ffffff) inset;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--color-text-primary, #0f172a);\n  -webkit-transition: background-color 5000s ease-in-out 0s;\n  transition: background-color 5000s ease-in-out 0s;\n}\n\n/* Label */\n.floating-input__label {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 16px;\n  top: 50%;\n  transform: translateY(-50%);\n  font-size: var(--text-base, 1rem);\n  color: var(--color-text-muted, #64748b);\n  pointer-events: auto;\n  transition: all var(--transition-normal, 200ms) var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n  background-color: transparent;\n  padding: 0 4px;\n  cursor: text;\n  -webkit-user-select: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.floating-input__input--with-left-icon + .floating-input__label {\n  left: 0;\n}\n\n/* Floating State */\n.floating-input__label--float {\n  top: 12px;\n  transform: translateY(0);\n  font-size: var(--text-small, 0.875rem);\n  color: var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n.floating-input--error .floating-input__label--float {\n  color: var(--color-error-500, #ef4444);\n}\n\n.floating-input--success .floating-input__label--float {\n  color: var(--color-success-500, #10b981);\n}\n\n/* Required Indicator */\n.floating-input__required {\n  color: var(--color-error-500, #ef4444);\n  margin-left: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Messages */\n.floating-input__message {\n  margin-top: var(--space-sm, 8px);\n  padding-left: var(--space-md, 16px);\n  font-size: var(--text-small, 0.875rem);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.floating-input__error {\n  color: var(--color-error-600, #dc2626);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--space-xs, 4px);\n  animation: errorSlideIn 0.3s var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n}\n\n.floating-input__helper {\n  color: var(--color-text-muted, #64748b);\n}\n\n@keyframes errorSlideIn {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Mobile Optimizations */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .floating-input-container {\n    min-height: 52px;\n  }\n\n  .floating-input__field {\n    min-height: 52px;\n  }\n\n  .floating-input__input {\n    font-size: 16px; /* Prevents zoom on iOS */\n    padding: 22px 12px 8px 12px;\n  }\n\n  .floating-input__label {\n    left: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .floating-input__input--with-left-icon + .floating-input__label {\n    left: 0;\n  }\n\n  .floating-input__icon--left {\n    padding-left: var(--space-sm, 12px);\n  }\n\n  .floating-input__icon--right {\n    padding-right: var(--space-sm, 12px);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Reduced Motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .floating-input-container,\n  .floating-input__icon,\n  .floating-input__input,\n  .floating-input__label {\n    transition: none;\n  }\n\n  .floating-input__status-icon,\n  .floating-input__error {\n    animation: none;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Dark Mode Support - Class-based for manual toggle */\n.dark .floating-input-container,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input-container {\n  background-color: #1e293b;\n  border-color: #475569;\n}\n\n.dark .floating-input-container:hover:not(.floating-input--error):not(.floating-input--disabled),\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input-container:hover:not(.floating-input--error):not(.floating-input--disabled) {\n  border-color: #64748b;\n}\n\n.dark .floating-input__input,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input__input {\n  color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.dark .floating-input__label,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input__label {\n  color: #94a3b8;\n}\n\n.dark .floating-input__label--float,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input__label--float {\n  color: #10b981;\n}\n\n.dark .floating-input__icon,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input__icon {\n  color: #94a3b8;\n}\n\n.dark .floating-input--focused .floating-input__icon,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input--focused .floating-input__icon {\n  color: #10b981;\n}\n\n.dark .floating-input__helper,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input__helper {\n  color: #94a3b8;\n}\n\n.dark .floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill,\n.dark .floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill:hover,\n.dark .floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill:focus,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill:hover,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill:focus {\n  -webkit-box-shadow: 0 0 0 1000px #1e293b inset;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.dark .floating-input--error,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .floating-input--error {\n  background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);\n  border-color: #ef4444;\n}\n\n/* System preference fallback */\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .floating-input-container {\n    background-color: var(--color-input-bg, #1e293b);\n    border-color: var(--color-border-primary, #475569);\n  }\n\n  .floating-input__input {\n    color: var(--color-text-primary, #f8fafc);\n  }\n\n  .floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill,\n  .floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill:hover,\n  .floating-input__input:-webkit-autofill:focus {\n    -webkit-box-shadow: 0 0 0 1000px var(--color-input-bg, #1e293b) inset;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--color-text-primary, #f8fafc);\n  }\n}\n\n/* High Contrast Mode */\n@media (prefers-contrast: high) {\n  .floating-input-container {\n    border-width: 3px;\n  }\n\n  .floating-input--focused {\n    border-width: 3px;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Focus Visible (Keyboard Navigation) */\n.floating-input__input:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);\n}\n\n/*# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;base64, */"],["STYLE",{},"/**\n * Gradient Button Styles\n * Enhanced button component with gradient backgrounds and animations\n */\n\n/* Base Button */\n.gradient-button {\n  position: relative;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 12px);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all var(--transition-normal, 200ms) var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n  overflow: hidden;\n  -webkit-user-select: none;\n  user-select: none;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n/* Button Sizes */\n.gradient-button--sm {\n  height: 36px;\n  padding: 0 var(--space-md, 16px);\n  font-size: var(--text-small, 0.875rem);\n  gap: var(--space-xs, 6px);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--md {\n  height: 44px;\n  padding: 0 var(--space-lg, 24px);\n  font-size: var(--text-base, 1rem);\n  gap: var(--space-sm, 8px);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--lg {\n  height: 52px;\n  padding: 0 var(--space-xl, 32px);\n  font-size: var(--text-lg, 1.125rem);\n  gap: var(--space-sm, 10px);\n}\n\n/* Full Width */\n.gradient-button--full-width {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n/* Button Content */\n.gradient-button__content {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: inherit;\n  transition: opacity var(--transition-fast, 150ms) var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n}\n\n.gradient-button__content--hidden {\n  opacity: 0;\n}\n\n.gradient-button__text {\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n/* Icons */\n.gradient-button__icon {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.gradient-button__icon svg {\n  width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n}\n\n.gradient-button--sm .gradient-button__icon svg {\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n}\n\n.gradient-button--lg .gradient-button__icon svg {\n  width: 20px;\n  height: 20px;\n}\n\n/* Loading State */\n.gradient-button__loader {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 50%;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.gradient-button__spinner {\n  animation: spin 1s linear infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes spin {\n  from {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  to {\n    transform: rotate(360deg);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Primary Variant (Green Gradient) */\n.gradient-button--primary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-brand-700, #047857), \n    var(--color-brand-800, #065f46)\n  );\n  color: white;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.3);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--primary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-brand-800, #065f46), \n    var(--color-brand-900, #064e3b)\n  );\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.4);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--primary:active:not(:disabled) {\n  transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.35);\n}\n\n/* Secondary Variant (Blue Gradient) */\n.gradient-button--secondary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-accent-500, #3b82f6), \n    var(--color-accent-600, #2563eb)\n  );\n  color: white;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--secondary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-accent-600, #2563eb), \n    var(--color-accent-700, #1d4ed8)\n  );\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--secondary:active:not(:disabled) {\n  transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);\n}\n\n/* Success Variant */\n.gradient-button--success {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-success-700, #047857), \n    var(--color-success-800, #065f46)\n  );\n  color: white;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.3);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--success:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-success-800, #065f46), \n    var(--color-success-900, #064e3b)\n  );\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.4);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--success:active:not(:disabled) {\n  transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);\n}\n\n/* Danger Variant */\n.gradient-button--danger {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-error-500, #ef4444), \n    var(--color-error-600, #dc2626)\n  );\n  color: white;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--danger:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-error-600, #dc2626), \n    var(--color-error-700, #b91c1c)\n  );\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--danger:active:not(:disabled) {\n  transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);\n}\n\n/* Outline Variant */\n.gradient-button--outline {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--color-brand-600, #059669);\n  border: 2px solid var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n.gradient-button--outline:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: var(--color-brand-50, #ecfdf5);\n  border-color: var(--color-brand-600, #059669);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--outline:active:not(:disabled) {\n  transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);\n  background: var(--color-brand-100, #d1fae5);\n}\n\n/* Ghost Variant */\n.gradient-button--ghost {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary, #0f172a);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n.gradient-button--ghost:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: var(--color-secondary-100, #f1f5f9);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--ghost:active:not(:disabled) {\n  transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);\n  background: var(--color-secondary-200, #e2e8f0);\n}\n\n/* Disabled State */\n.gradient-button--disabled,\n.gradient-button:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.5;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n/* Disabled state text contrast fix — ensure 3:1 minimum even at 50% opacity */\n.dark .gradient-button--disabled,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--disabled,\n.dark .gradient-button:disabled,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.6; /* Slightly higher for dark mode legibility */\n}\n\n/* Loading State */\n.gradient-button--loading {\n  cursor: wait;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n/* Focus Visible (Keyboard Navigation) */\n.gradient-button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.gradient-button--outline:focus-visible {\n  outline-color: var(--color-brand-600, #059669);\n}\n\n.gradient-button--danger:focus-visible {\n  outline-color: var(--color-error-500, #ef4444);\n}\n\n/* Ripple Effect */\n.gradient-button::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 50%;\n  left: 50%;\n  width: 0;\n  height: 0;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n  transition: width 0.6s, height 0.6s;\n}\n\n.gradient-button:active:not(:disabled)::before {\n  width: 300px;\n  height: 300px;\n  transition: width 0s, height 0s;\n}\n\n/* Mobile Optimizations */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .gradient-button--sm {\n    height: 40px;\n    padding: 0 var(--space-md, 14px);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-button--md {\n    height: 48px;\n    padding: 0 var(--space-lg, 20px);\n    font-size: 16px; /* Prevents zoom on iOS */\n  }\n\n  .gradient-button--lg {\n    height: 56px;\n    padding: 0 var(--space-xl, 28px);\n  }\n\n  /* Increase touch target */\n  .gradient-button {\n    min-height: 44px;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Reduced Motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .gradient-button,\n  .gradient-button__content,\n  .gradient-button::before {\n    transition: none;\n  }\n\n  .gradient-button__spinner {\n    animation: none;\n  }\n\n  .gradient-button:hover:not(:disabled) {\n    transform: none;\n  }\n\n  .gradient-button:active:not(:disabled) {\n    transform: none;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Dark Mode Support - Class-based for manual toggle */\n.dark .gradient-button--outline,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--outline {\n  color: #34d399;\n  border-color: #10b981;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-button--outline:hover:not(:disabled),\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--outline:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-button--ghost,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--ghost {\n  color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-button--ghost:hover:not(:disabled),\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--ghost:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: #1e293b;\n}\n\n/* Dark mode: primary & secondary button shadow adjustments */\n.dark .gradient-button--primary,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--primary {\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-button--primary:hover:not(:disabled),\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--primary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-button--secondary,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--secondary {\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-button--secondary:hover:not(:disabled),\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--secondary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-button--danger,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--danger {\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35);\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-button--danger:hover:not(:disabled),\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--danger:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.5);\n}\n\n/* Dark mode: success variant */\n.dark .gradient-button--success,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--success {\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-button--success:hover:not(:disabled),\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-button--success:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);\n}\n\n/* System preference fallback */\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .gradient-button--outline {\n    color: var(--color-brand-400, #34d399);\n    border-color: var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-button--outline:hover:not(:disabled) {\n    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-button--ghost {\n    color: var(--color-text-primary, #f8fafc);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-button--ghost:hover:not(:disabled) {\n    background: var(--color-secondary-800, #1e293b);\n  }\n}\n\n/* High Contrast Mode */\n@media (prefers-contrast: high) {\n  .gradient-button {\n    border: 2px solid currentColor;\n  }\n\n  .gradient-button--outline {\n    border-width: 3px;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Print Styles */\n@media print {\n  .gradient-button {\n    background: none !important;\n    color: black !important;\n    border: 1px solid black !important;\n    box-shadow: none !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/*# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;base64, */"],["STYLE",{},"/**\n * Gradient Card Styles\n * Enhanced card component with gradient backgrounds and animations\n */\n\n/* Base Card */\n.gradient-card {\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-xl, 16px);\n  transition: all var(--transition-normal, 200ms) var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* Padding Variants */\n.gradient-card--padding-none {\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n.gradient-card--padding-sm {\n  padding: var(--space-md, 16px);\n}\n\n.gradient-card--padding-md {\n  padding: var(--space-lg, 24px);\n}\n\n.gradient-card--padding-lg {\n  padding: var(--space-xl, 32px);\n}\n\n/* Shadow */\n.gradient-card--shadow {\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm, 0 1px 3px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1));\n}\n\n/* Border */\n.gradient-card--border {\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-primary, #e2e8f0);\n}\n\n/* Hoverable */\n.gradient-card--hoverable:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-4px);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg, 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1));\n}\n\n/* Clickable */\n.gradient-card--clickable {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  -webkit-user-select: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.gradient-card--clickable:active {\n  transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);\n}\n\n.gradient-card--clickable:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Primary Variant (Green Gradient) */\n.gradient-card--primary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-brand-50, #ecfdf5), \n    var(--color-brand-100, #d1fae5)\n  );\n  border-color: var(--color-brand-200, #a7f3d0);\n}\n\n.gradient-card--primary.gradient-card--hoverable:hover {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-brand-100, #d1fae5), \n    var(--color-brand-200, #a7f3d0)\n  );\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);\n}\n\n/* Secondary Variant (Blue Gradient) */\n.gradient-card--secondary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-accent-50, #eff6ff), \n    var(--color-accent-100, #dbeafe)\n  );\n  border-color: var(--color-accent-200, #bfdbfe);\n}\n\n.gradient-card--secondary.gradient-card--hoverable:hover {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-accent-100, #dbeafe), \n    var(--color-accent-200, #bfdbfe)\n  );\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);\n}\n\n/* Success Variant */\n.gradient-card--success {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-success-50, #ecfdf5), \n    var(--color-success-100, #d1fae5)\n  );\n  border-color: var(--color-success-200, #a7f3d0);\n}\n\n.gradient-card--success.gradient-card--hoverable:hover {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-success-100, #d1fae5), \n    var(--color-success-200, #a7f3d0)\n  );\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);\n}\n\n/* Info Variant */\n.gradient-card--info {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-info-50, #eff6ff), \n    var(--color-info-100, #dbeafe)\n  );\n  border-color: var(--color-info-200, #bfdbfe);\n}\n\n.gradient-card--info.gradient-card--hoverable:hover {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-info-100, #dbeafe), \n    var(--color-info-200, #bfdbfe)\n  );\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);\n}\n\n/* Warning Variant */\n.gradient-card--warning {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-warning-50, #fffbeb), \n    var(--color-warning-100, #fef3c7)\n  );\n  border-color: var(--color-warning-200, #fde68a);\n}\n\n.gradient-card--warning.gradient-card--hoverable:hover {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-warning-100, #fef3c7), \n    var(--color-warning-200, #fde68a)\n  );\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);\n}\n\n/* Danger Variant */\n.gradient-card--danger {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-error-50, #fef2f2), \n    var(--color-error-100, #fee2e2)\n  );\n  border-color: var(--color-error-200, #fecaca);\n}\n\n.gradient-card--danger.gradient-card--hoverable:hover {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-error-100, #fee2e2), \n    var(--color-error-200, #fecaca)\n  );\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);\n}\n\n/* Neutral Variant */\n.gradient-card--neutral {\n  background: var(--color-card-bg, #ffffff);\n  border-color: var(--color-border-primary, #e2e8f0);\n}\n\n.gradient-card--neutral.gradient-card--hoverable:hover {\n  background: var(--color-secondary-50, #f8fafc);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md, 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1));\n}\n\n/* Card Sections */\n.gradient-card__header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: var(--space-md, 16px);\n  padding-bottom: var(--space-md, 16px);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-primary, #e2e8f0);\n}\n\n.gradient-card__body {\n  flex: 1 1;\n}\n\n.gradient-card__footer {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-top: var(--space-md, 16px);\n  padding-top: var(--space-md, 16px);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-primary, #e2e8f0);\n}\n\n/* Card Title */\n.gradient-card__title {\n  font-size: var(--text-xl, 1.25rem);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary, #0f172a);\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* Card Description */\n.gradient-card__description {\n  font-size: var(--text-base, 1rem);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary, #475569);\n  margin: var(--space-sm, 8px) 0 0 0;\n}\n\n/* Card Icon */\n.gradient-card__icon {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 48px;\n  height: 48px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 12px);\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-brand-50, #ecfdf5), \n    var(--color-brand-100, #d1fae5)\n  );\n  margin-bottom: var(--space-md, 16px);\n}\n\n.gradient-card__icon svg {\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 24px;\n  color: var(--color-brand-600, #059669);\n}\n\n/* Shimmer Effect for Loading */\n.gradient-card--loading {\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.gradient-card--loading::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: -100%;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    90deg,\n    transparent 0%,\n    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) 50%,\n    transparent 100%\n  );\n  animation: shimmer 2s infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes shimmer {\n  0% {\n    left: -100%;\n  }\n  100% {\n    left: 100%;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Mobile Optimizations */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .gradient-card--padding-sm {\n    padding: var(--space-sm, 12px);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card--padding-md {\n    padding: var(--space-md, 16px);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card--padding-lg {\n    padding: var(--space-lg, 24px);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card__title {\n    font-size: var(--text-lg, 1.125rem);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card__description {\n    font-size: var(--text-small, 0.875rem);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card__icon {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card__icon svg {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Reduced Motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .gradient-card,\n  .gradient-card--hoverable:hover,\n  .gradient-card--clickable:active {\n    transition: none;\n    transform: none;\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card--loading::before {\n    animation: none;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Dark Mode Support - Class-based for manual toggle */\n.dark .gradient-card--neutral,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card--neutral {\n  background: #1e293b;\n  border-color: #475569;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card--neutral.gradient-card--hoverable:hover,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card--neutral.gradient-card--hoverable:hover {\n  background: #334155;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card__header,\n.dark .gradient-card__footer,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card__header,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card__footer {\n  border-color: #475569;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card__title,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card__title {\n  color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card__description,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card__description {\n  color: #cbd5e1;\n}\n\n/* Dark mode for all gradient card variants */\n.dark .gradient-card--primary,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card--primary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b, #065f46);\n  border-color: #10b981;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card--secondary,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card--secondary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a5f, #1e40af);\n  border-color: #3b82f6;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card--success,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card--success {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b, #065f46);\n  border-color: #10b981;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card--info,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card--info {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a5f, #1e40af);\n  border-color: #3b82f6;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card--warning,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card--warning {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #78350f, #92400e);\n  border-color: #f59e0b;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card--danger,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card--danger {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7f1d1d, #991b1b);\n  border-color: #ef4444;\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card__icon,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card__icon {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b, #065f46);\n}\n\n.dark .gradient-card__icon svg,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .gradient-card__icon svg {\n  color: #34d399;\n}\n\n/* System preference fallback */\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .gradient-card--neutral {\n    background: var(--color-card-bg, #1e293b);\n    border-color: var(--color-border-primary, #475569);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card--neutral.gradient-card--hoverable:hover {\n    background: var(--color-secondary-800, #334155);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card__header,\n  .gradient-card__footer {\n    border-color: var(--color-border-primary, #475569);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card__title {\n    color: var(--color-text-primary, #f8fafc);\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card__description {\n    color: var(--color-text-secondary, #cbd5e1);\n  }\n}\n\n/* High Contrast Mode */\n@media (prefers-contrast: high) {\n  .gradient-card {\n    border-width: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card--clickable:focus-visible {\n    outline-width: 4px;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Print Styles */\n@media print {\n  .gradient-card {\n    background: white !important;\n    border: 1px solid black !important;\n    box-shadow: none !important;\n    page-break-inside: avoid;\n  }\n\n  .gradient-card--hoverable:hover,\n  .gradient-card--clickable:active {\n    transform: none !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/*# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;base64, */"],["STYLE",{},"/**\n * Stat Card Styles\n * Dashboard-style KPI card component\n */\n\n/* Base Card */\n.stat-card {\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--space-md, 16px);\n  padding: var(--space-lg, 24px);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 12px);\n  transition: all var(--transition-normal, 200ms) var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1));\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* Clickable */\n.stat-card--clickable {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.stat-card--clickable:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n\n.stat-card--clickable:active {\n  transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);\n}\n\n.stat-card--clickable:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Variants */\n.stat-card--primary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-brand-50, #ecfdf5), \n    var(--color-brand-100, #d1fae5)\n  );\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-brand-200, #a7f3d0);\n}\n\n.stat-card--secondary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-accent-50, #eff6ff), \n    var(--color-accent-100, #dbeafe)\n  );\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-200, #bfdbfe);\n}\n\n.stat-card--success {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-success-50, #ecfdf5), \n    var(--color-success-100, #d1fae5)\n  );\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-success-200, #a7f3d0);\n}\n\n.stat-card--info {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-info-50, #eff6ff), \n    var(--color-info-100, #dbeafe)\n  );\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-info-200, #bfdbfe);\n}\n\n.stat-card--warning {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-warning-50, #fffbeb), \n    var(--color-warning-100, #fef3c7)\n  );\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-warning-200, #fde68a);\n}\n\n.stat-card--danger {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, \n    var(--color-error-50, #fef2f2), \n    var(--color-error-100, #fee2e2)\n  );\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-error-200, #fecaca);\n}\n\n/* Icon */\n.stat-card__icon {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 48px;\n  height: 48px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 12px);\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n}\n\n.stat-card__icon-emoji {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.stat-card__icon svg {\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 24px;\n  color: var(--color-brand-600, #059669);\n}\n\n.stat-card--secondary .stat-card__icon svg {\n  color: var(--color-accent-600, #2563eb);\n}\n\n.stat-card--success .stat-card__icon svg {\n  color: var(--color-success-600, #059669);\n}\n\n.stat-card--info .stat-card__icon svg {\n  color: var(--color-info-600, #2563eb);\n}\n\n.stat-card--warning .stat-card__icon svg {\n  color: var(--color-warning-600, #d97706);\n}\n\n.stat-card--danger .stat-card__icon svg {\n  color: var(--color-error-600, #dc2626);\n}\n\n/* Content */\n.stat-card__content {\n  flex: 1 1;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n/* Value */\n.stat-card__value {\n  font-size: var(--text-3xl, 1.875rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary, #0f172a);\n  margin-bottom: var(--space-xs, 4px);\n}\n\n/* Label */\n.stat-card__label {\n  font-size: var(--text-small, 0.875rem);\n  font-weight: 500;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary, #475569);\n}\n\n/* Trend */\n.stat-card__trend {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--space-xs, 4px);\n  margin-top: var(--space-sm, 8px);\n  font-size: var(--text-small, 0.875rem);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.stat-card__trend-icon {\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n}\n\n.stat-card__trend--up {\n  color: var(--color-success-600, #059669);\n}\n\n.stat-card__trend--up .stat-card__trend-icon {\n  color: var(--color-success-600, #059669);\n}\n\n.stat-card__trend--down {\n  color: var(--color-error-600, #dc2626);\n}\n\n.stat-card__trend--down .stat-card__trend-icon {\n  color: var(--color-error-600, #dc2626);\n}\n\n.stat-card__trend--neutral {\n  color: var(--color-text-muted, #64748b);\n}\n\n.stat-card__trend--neutral .stat-card__trend-icon {\n  color: var(--color-text-muted, #64748b);\n}\n\n/* Loading Skeleton */\n.stat-card--loading {\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.stat-card__skeleton {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--space-md, 16px);\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.stat-card__skeleton-icon {\n  width: 48px;\n  height: 48px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 12px);\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    90deg,\n    #f0f0f0 0%,\n    #f8f8f8 50%,\n    #f0f0f0 100%\n  );\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: shimmer 1.5s infinite;\n}\n\n.stat-card__skeleton-content {\n  flex: 1 1;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--space-sm, 8px);\n}\n\n.stat-card__skeleton-value {\n  width: 80px;\n  height: 32px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    90deg,\n    #f0f0f0 0%,\n    #f8f8f8 50%,\n    #f0f0f0 100%\n  );\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: shimmer 1.5s infinite;\n}\n\n.stat-card__skeleton-label {\n  width: 120px;\n  height: 16px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm, 4px);\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    90deg,\n    #f0f0f0 0%,\n    #f8f8f8 50%,\n    #f0f0f0 100%\n  );\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: shimmer 1.5s infinite;\n  animation-delay: 0.1s;\n}\n\n@keyframes shimmer {\n  0% {\n    background-position: -200% 0;\n  }\n  100% {\n    background-position: 200% 0;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Mobile Optimizations */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .stat-card {\n    padding: var(--space-md, 16px);\n    gap: var(--space-sm, 12px);\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__icon {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__icon-emoji {\n    font-size: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__icon svg {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__value {\n    font-size: var(--text-2xl, 1.5rem);\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__label {\n    font-size: var(--text-tiny, 0.75rem);\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__trend {\n    font-size: var(--text-tiny, 0.75rem);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Reduced Motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .stat-card,\n  .stat-card--clickable:hover,\n  .stat-card--clickable:active {\n    transition: none;\n    transform: none;\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__skeleton-icon,\n  .stat-card__skeleton-value,\n  .stat-card__skeleton-label {\n    animation: none;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Dark Mode Support - Class-based for manual toggle */\n.dark .stat-card__value,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .stat-card__value {\n  color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.dark .stat-card__label,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .stat-card__label {\n  color: #cbd5e1;\n}\n\n.dark .stat-card__icon,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .stat-card__icon {\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n.dark .stat-card__skeleton-icon,\n.dark .stat-card__skeleton-value,\n.dark .stat-card__skeleton-label,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .stat-card__skeleton-icon,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .stat-card__skeleton-value,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .stat-card__skeleton-label {\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    90deg,\n    #334155 0%,\n    #475569 50%,\n    #334155 100%\n  );\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n}\n\n/* System preference fallback */\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .stat-card__value {\n    color: var(--color-text-primary, #f8fafc);\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__label {\n    color: var(--color-text-secondary, #cbd5e1);\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__icon {\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__skeleton-icon,\n  .stat-card__skeleton-value,\n  .stat-card__skeleton-label {\n    background: linear-gradient(\n      90deg,\n      #334155 0%,\n      #475569 50%,\n      #334155 100%\n    );\n    background-size: 200% 100%;\n  }\n}\n\n/* High Contrast Mode */\n@media (prefers-contrast: high) {\n  .stat-card {\n    border-width: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .stat-card--clickable:focus-visible {\n    outline-width: 4px;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Print Styles */\n@media print {\n  .stat-card {\n    background: white !important;\n    border: 1px solid black !important;\n    page-break-inside: avoid;\n  }\n\n  .stat-card--clickable:hover,\n  .stat-card--clickable:active {\n    transform: none !important;\n  }\n\n  .stat-card__trend {\n    color: black !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/*# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;base64, */"],["STYLE",{},"/**\n * @fileoverview NotificationBell Component Styles\n * @description Styles for real-time notification bell and dropdown\n */\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Notification Bell Button\n   ============================================================ */\n\n.notification-bell {\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 40px;\n  height: 40px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary, #6B7280);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 150ms ease;\n}\n\n.notification-bell:hover {\n  background: var(--color-gray-100, #F3F4F6);\n  color: var(--color-text-primary, #1F2937);\n}\n\n.notification-bell.dark {\n  color: var(--color-gray-400, #9CA3AF);\n}\n\n.notification-bell.dark:hover {\n  background: var(--color-gray-700, #374151);\n  color: var(--color-gray-100, #F3F4F6);\n}\n\n.notification-bell:focus {\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n.notification-bell:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary, #3B82F6);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Badge */\n.notification-badge {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 4px;\n  right: 4px;\n  min-width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n  padding: 0 5px;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 18px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: white;\n  background: var(--color-error, #EF4444);\n  border-radius: 9px;\n  animation: badge-pop 300ms cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n@keyframes badge-pop {\n  0% { transform: scale(0); }\n  50% { transform: scale(1.2); }\n  100% { transform: scale(1); }\n}\n\n/* Offline indicator */\n.notification-offline {\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 6px;\n  right: 6px;\n  width: 8px;\n  height: 8px;\n  background: var(--color-warning, #F59E0B);\n  border: 2px solid white;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n}\n\n.notification-bell.dark .notification-offline {\n  border-color: var(--color-gray-800, #1F2937);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Notification Dropdown\n   ============================================================ */\n\n.notification-dropdown {\n  width: 380px;\n  max-width: calc(100vw - 32px);\n  max-height: 500px;\n  background: white;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-gray-200, #E5E7EB);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n  z-index: 1000;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  animation: dropdown-enter 200ms ease;\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown.dark {\n  background: var(--color-gray-800, #1F2937);\n  border-color: var(--color-gray-700, #374151);\n}\n\n@keyframes dropdown-enter {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(-8px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Header */\n.notification-dropdown-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-gray-200, #E5E7EB);\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown.dark .notification-dropdown-header {\n  border-color: var(--color-gray-700, #374151);\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown-header h3 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary, #1F2937);\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown.dark .notification-dropdown-header h3 {\n  color: white;\n}\n\n.notification-header-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.notification-header-btn {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 32px;\n  height: 32px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--color-gray-500, #6B7280);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 150ms ease;\n}\n\n.notification-header-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--color-gray-100, #F3F4F6);\n  color: var(--color-gray-700, #374151);\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown.dark .notification-header-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--color-gray-700, #374151);\n  color: var(--color-gray-300, #D1D5DB);\n}\n\n.notification-header-btn.close:hover {\n  background: var(--color-error-light, #FEE2E2);\n  color: var(--color-error, #EF4444);\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown.dark .notification-header-btn.close:hover {\n  background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);\n}\n\n/* Connection Warning */\n.notification-connection-warning {\n  padding: 8px 16px;\n  background: var(--color-warning-light, #FEF3C7);\n  color: var(--color-warning-dark, #B45309);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown.dark .notification-connection-warning {\n  background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);\n  color: var(--color-warning, #F59E0B);\n}\n\n/* Notifications List */\n.notification-list {\n  flex: 1 1;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  max-height: 360px;\n}\n\n/* Empty State */\n.notification-empty {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 48px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--color-gray-500, #6B7280);\n}\n\n.notification-empty p {\n  margin: 12px 0 4px;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary, #1F2937);\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown.dark .notification-empty p {\n  color: var(--color-gray-300, #D1D5DB);\n}\n\n.notification-empty span {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--color-gray-500, #6B7280);\n}\n\n/* Footer */\n.notification-dropdown-footer {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 10px 16px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-gray-200, #E5E7EB);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--color-gray-500, #6B7280);\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown.dark .notification-dropdown-footer {\n  border-color: var(--color-gray-700, #374151);\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown-footer .unread-count {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-primary, #3B82F6);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Notification Item\n   ============================================================ */\n\n.notification-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 12px;\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-gray-100, #F3F4F6);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color 150ms ease;\n}\n\n.notification-item:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.notification-item:hover {\n  background: var(--color-gray-50, #F9FAFB);\n}\n\n.notification-item.dark {\n  border-color: var(--color-gray-700, #374151);\n}\n\n.notification-item.dark:hover {\n  background: var(--color-gray-750, #2D3748);\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread {\n  background: var(--color-primary-alpha, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05));\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread.dark {\n  background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);\n}\n\n/* Icon */\n.notification-icon {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 36px;\n  height: 36px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.notification-icon.blue { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); }\n.notification-icon.green { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); }\n.notification-icon.red { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); }\n.notification-icon.yellow { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); }\n.notification-icon.purple { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15); }\n.notification-icon.gray { background: rgba(107, 114, 128, 0.15); }\n\n/* Content */\n.notification-content {\n  flex: 1 1;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n.notification-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin-bottom: 2px;\n}\n\n.notification-title {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary, #1F2937);\n}\n\n.notification-item.dark .notification-title {\n  color: white;\n}\n\n.notification-time {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--color-gray-500, #6B7280);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.notification-message {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary, #6B7280);\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  display: -webkit-box;\n  -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\n  line-clamp: 2;\n  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.notification-item.dark .notification-message {\n  color: var(--color-gray-400, #9CA3AF);\n}\n\n.notification-meta {\n  margin: 4px 0 0;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--color-gray-500, #6B7280);\n}\n\n/* Actions */\n.notification-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: opacity 150ms ease;\n}\n\n.notification-item:hover .notification-actions {\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.notification-action-btn {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 28px;\n  height: 28px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--color-gray-400, #9CA3AF);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 150ms ease;\n}\n\n.notification-action-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--color-gray-200, #E5E7EB);\n  color: var(--color-gray-700, #374151);\n}\n\n.notification-item.dark .notification-action-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--color-gray-600, #4B5563);\n  color: var(--color-gray-200, #E5E7EB);\n}\n\n.notification-action-btn.delete:hover {\n  background: var(--color-error-light, #FEE2E2);\n  color: var(--color-error, #EF4444);\n}\n\n.notification-item.dark .notification-action-btn.delete:hover {\n  background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);\n  color: var(--color-error, #EF4444);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Responsive\n   ============================================================ */\n\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  .notification-dropdown {\n    width: calc(100vw - 16px);\n    max-height: 70vh;\n    right: 8px !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Reduced Motion\n   ============================================================ */\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .notification-badge,\n  .notification-dropdown,\n  .notification-item,\n  .notification-bell {\n    animation: none;\n    transition: none;\n  }\n}\n\n/*# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;base64, */"],["STYLE",{},"/* ==========================================================================\n   Base & Reset Enhancements\n   ========================================================================== */\n\nhtml {\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n  text-size-adjust: 100%;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  html {\n    scroll-behavior: auto;\n  }\n\n  *, *::before, *::after {\n    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Focus Styles - Accessible & Beautiful\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* Remove default focus outline but add it back with better styling */\n*:focus {\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n/* Visible focus for keyboard navigation only */\n*:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n/* Focus within for parent containers */\n.focus-within-ring:focus-within {\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--color-brand-500, #10b981);\n}\n\n/* Skip to main content link */\n.skip-link {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -40px;\n  left: 0;\n  background: var(--color-brand-600, #059669);\n  color: white;\n  padding: 8px 16px;\n  z-index: 9999;\n  transition: top 0.2s ease-in-out;\n  border-radius: 0 0 8px 0;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n.skip-link:focus {\n  top: 0;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Animation Keyframes\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from { opacity: 0; }\n  to { opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeOut {\n  from { opacity: 1; }\n  to { opacity: 0; }\n}\n\n@keyframes slideInFromTop {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(-10px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes slideInFromBottom {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(10px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes slideInFromLeft {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateX(-10px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateX(0);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes slideInFromRight {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateX(10px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateX(0);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes scaleIn {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scale(0.95);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: scale(1);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes pulse {\n  0%, 100% {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n  50% {\n    opacity: 0.5;\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes spin {\n  from {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  to {\n    transform: rotate(360deg);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes bounce {\n  0%, 100% {\n    transform: translateY(-5%);\n    animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.8, 0, 1, 1);\n  }\n  50% {\n    transform: translateY(0);\n    animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes shake {\n  0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }\n  10%, 30%, 50%, 70%, 90% { transform: translateX(-4px); }\n  20%, 40%, 60%, 80% { transform: translateX(4px); }\n}\n\n@keyframes shimmer {\n  0% {\n    background-position: -200% 0;\n  }\n  100% {\n    background-position: 200% 0;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Animation utility classes */\n.animate-fade-in {\n  animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease-out;\n}\n\n.animate-slide-in-top {\n  animation: slideInFromTop 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n\n.animate-slide-in-bottom {\n  animation: slideInFromBottom 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n\n.animate-slide-in-left {\n  animation: slideInFromLeft 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n\n.animate-slide-in-right {\n  animation: slideInFromRight 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n\n.animate-scale-in {\n  animation: scaleIn 0.2s ease-out;\n}\n\n.animate-pulse {\n  animation: pulse 2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.6, 1) infinite;\n}\n\n.animate-spin {\n  animation: spin 1s linear infinite;\n}\n\n.animate-bounce {\n  animation: bounce 1s infinite;\n}\n\n.animate-shake {\n  animation: shake 0.5s ease-in-out;\n}\n\n.animate-shimmer {\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    90deg,\n    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0%,\n    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) 50%,\n    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%\n  );\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: shimmer 1.5s infinite;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Transition Utilities\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.transition-fast {\n  transition: all 0.15s ease-out;\n}\n\n.transition-normal {\n  transition: all 0.2s ease-out;\n}\n\n.transition-slow {\n  transition: all 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n\n.transition-colors {\n  transition: color 0.2s, background-color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.transition-transform {\n  transition: transform 0.2s ease-out;\n}\n\n.transition-opacity {\n  transition: opacity 0.2s ease-out;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Interactive States\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.hover-lift {\n  transition: transform 0.2s ease-out, box-shadow 0.2s ease-out;\n}\n\n.hover-lift:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n\n.hover-scale {\n  transition: transform 0.2s ease-out;\n}\n\n.hover-scale:hover {\n  transform: scale(1.02);\n}\n\n.hover-glow {\n  transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease-out;\n}\n\n.hover-glow:hover {\n  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);\n}\n\n.active-press:active {\n  transform: scale(0.98);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Touch & Mobile Enhancements\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* Touch target minimum size */\n.touch-target {\n  min-width: 44px;\n  min-height: 44px;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n/* Safe area insets for notched devices */\n.safe-area-inset-top {\n  padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);\n}\n\n.safe-area-inset-bottom {\n  padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);\n}\n\n.safe-area-inset-left {\n  padding-left: env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px);\n}\n\n.safe-area-inset-right {\n  padding-right: env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px);\n}\n\n/* Prevent text selection on buttons */\nbutton, [role=\"button\"] {\n  -webkit-user-select: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Scrollbar Styling\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 8px;\n  height: 8px;\n}\n\n.custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n/* Hide scrollbar but allow scrolling */\n.scrollbar-hide {\n  -ms-overflow-style: none;\n  scrollbar-width: none;\n}\n\n.scrollbar-hide::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   High Contrast Mode Support\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n@media (prefers-contrast: high) {\n  *:focus-visible {\n    outline-width: 3px;\n    outline-color: currentColor;\n  }\n\n  button, [role=\"button\"], a {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n\n  .card, .modal, .dropdown {\n    border: 2px solid currentColor;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Print Styles\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n@media print {\n  /* Hide non-essential elements */\n  nav, .sidebar, .toast, .modal-overlay, .toolbar, .modal, button[aria-label*=\"close\"] {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  /* Ensure good contrast */\n  body {\n    color: #000 !important;\n    background: #fff !important;\n  }\n\n  a {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    color: #000 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* Show link URLs */\n  a[href]:after {\n    content: \" (\" attr(href) \")\";\n    font-size: 0.8em;\n  }\n\n  /* Page break controls */\n  .page-break-before {\n    page-break-before: always;\n  }\n\n  .page-break-after {\n    page-break-after: always;\n  }\n\n  .no-page-break {\n    page-break-inside: avoid;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Loading & Skeleton States\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.skeleton {\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    90deg,\n    #f0f0f0 25%,\n    #e0e0e0 50%,\n    #f0f0f0 75%\n  );\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: shimmer 1.5s infinite;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.loading-dots::after {\n  content: '';\n  animation: dots 1.5s steps(4) infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes dots {\n  0% { content: ''; }\n  25% { content: '.'; }\n  50% { content: '..'; }\n  75% { content: '...'; }\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   RTL (Right-to-Left) Support\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* Base RTL styles */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] {\n  direction: rtl;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n/* RTL text alignment utilities */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .text-left {\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .text-right {\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n/* RTL flex direction */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .flex-row {\n  flex-direction: row-reverse;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .flex-row-reverse {\n  flex-direction: row;\n}\n\n/* RTL margins and paddings */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .ml-auto {\n  margin-left: 0;\n  margin-right: auto;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .mr-auto {\n  margin-right: 0;\n  margin-left: auto;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .pl-4 {\n  padding-left: 0;\n  padding-right: 1rem;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .pr-4 {\n  padding-right: 0;\n  padding-left: 1rem;\n}\n\n/* RTL positioning */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .left-0 {\n  left: auto;\n  right: 0;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .right-0 {\n  right: auto;\n  left: 0;\n}\n\n/* RTL borders */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .border-l {\n  border-left: none;\n  border-right: 1px solid;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .border-r {\n  border-right: none;\n  border-left: 1px solid;\n}\n\n/* RTL transforms for icons/arrows */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .rtl-flip {\n  transform: scaleX(-1);\n}\n\n/* RTL slide animations */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .animate-slide-in-left {\n  animation: slideInFromRight 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .animate-slide-in-right {\n  animation: slideInFromLeft 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n\n/* RTL navigation */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] nav ul {\n  padding-right: 0;\n}\n\n/* RTL forms */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] input,\n[dir=\"rtl\"] textarea,\n[dir=\"rtl\"] select {\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] input[type=\"email\"],\n[dir=\"rtl\"] input[type=\"url\"],\n[dir=\"rtl\"] input[type=\"tel\"] {\n  direction: ltr;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n/* RTL checkboxes and radios */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] input[type=\"checkbox\"],\n[dir=\"rtl\"] input[type=\"radio\"] {\n  margin-left: 0.5rem;\n  margin-right: 0;\n}\n\n/* RTL icons in buttons */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .btn-icon-left svg {\n  margin-right: 0;\n  margin-left: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .btn-icon-right svg {\n  margin-left: 0;\n  margin-right: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n/* RTL list styles */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] ul, [dir=\"rtl\"] ol {\n  padding-right: 1.5rem;\n  padding-left: 0;\n}\n\n/* RTL table alignment */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] th, [dir=\"rtl\"] td {\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n/* RTL modal positioning */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .modal-close {\n  right: auto;\n  left: 1rem;\n}\n\n/* RTL sidebar */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .sidebar {\n  left: auto;\n  right: 0;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .sidebar-closed {\n  transform: translateX(100%);\n}\n\n/* RTL dropdown menus */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .dropdown-menu {\n  left: auto;\n  right: 0;\n}\n\n/* RTL progress bars */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .progress-bar {\n  direction: rtl;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .progress-fill {\n  transform-origin: right center;\n}\n\n/* RTL breadcrumbs */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .breadcrumb-separator {\n  transform: scaleX(-1);\n}\n\n/* RTL tooltips */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .tooltip-left {\n  left: auto;\n  right: 100%;\n}\n\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .tooltip-right {\n  right: auto;\n  left: 100%;\n}\n\n/* RTL card layouts */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] .card-actions {\n  flex-direction: row-reverse;\n}\n\n/* RTL number inputs remain LTR */\n[dir=\"rtl\"] input[type=\"number\"] {\n  direction: ltr;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Form Input Accessibility Fixes (P2.1 & P2.2)\n   WCAG 2.1 AA compliant contrast ratios\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* P2.1: Placeholder Contrast Fix\n   Light mode: #6B7280 on #FFFFFF = 4.5:1 contrast (PASS)\n   Dark mode: #9CA3AF on #1E293B = 3:1 contrast (ACCEPTABLE for placeholders)\n*/\n::placeholder {\n  color: #6B7280; /* gray-500 - meets 4.5:1 on white */\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.dark ::placeholder,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] ::placeholder {\n  color: #9CA3AF; /* gray-400 - good visibility on dark */\n}\n\n/* P2.2: Dark Mode Input Border Contrast Fix\n   #64748B on #1E293B = 3:1 contrast (PASS for UI components)\n*/\n.dark input,\n.dark textarea,\n.dark select,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] input,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] textarea,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] select {\n  border-color: #64748B; /* slate-500 - meets 3:1 */\n}\n\n/* Keep focus and error states */\n.dark input:focus,\n.dark textarea:focus,\n.dark select:focus,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] input:focus,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] textarea:focus,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] select:focus {\n  border-color: #10B981; /* green-500 for focus */\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);\n}\n\n.dark input[aria-invalid=\"true\"],\n.dark textarea[aria-invalid=\"true\"],\n.dark select[aria-invalid=\"true\"],\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] input[aria-invalid=\"true\"],\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] textarea[aria-invalid=\"true\"],\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] select[aria-invalid=\"true\"] {\n  border-color: #EF4444; /* red-500 for errors */\n}\n\n/* P2.3: Dropdown Theming (Dark Mode) */\n.dark select,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] select {\n  background-color: #1E293B; /* slate-800 */\n  color: #E2E8F0; /* slate-200 */\n}\n\n.dark select option,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] select option {\n  background-color: #1E293B;\n  color: #E2E8F0;\n}\n\n.dark select:hover,\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] select:hover {\n  background-color: #334155; /* slate-700 */\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Dark Mode Support (Future)\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  :root.auto-dark-mode {\n    --bg-primary: #1a1a2e;\n    --bg-secondary: #16213e;\n    --bg-tertiary: #0f3460;\n    --text-primary: #eaeaea;\n    --text-secondary: #b8b8b8;\n    --border-color: #2d2d44;\n  }\n  \n  /* Auto dark mode placeholder fix */\n  :root.auto-dark-mode ::placeholder {\n    color: #9CA3AF;\n  }\n  \n  /* Auto dark mode input border fix */\n  :root.auto-dark-mode input,\n  :root.auto-dark-mode textarea,\n  :root.auto-dark-mode select {\n    border-color: #64748B;\n  }\n}\n\n/*# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;base64, */"],["STYLE",{},"/**\n * Design System CSS Variables\n * \n * CSS custom properties that provide dynamic theming support\n * for the SecureGate design system.\n */\n\n:root {\n  /* Brand Colors */\n  --color-brand-50: #ecfdf5;\n  --color-brand-100: #d1fae5;\n  --color-brand-200: #a7f3d0;\n  --color-brand-300: #6ee7b7;\n  --color-brand-400: #34d399;\n  --color-brand-500: #10b981;\n  --color-brand-600: #059669;\n  --color-brand-700: #047857;\n  --color-brand-800: #065f46;\n  --color-brand-900: #064e3b;\n\n  /* Primary Colors (alias for brand) */\n  --color-primary-50: #ecfdf5;\n  --color-primary-100: #d1fae5;\n  --color-primary-200: #a7f3d0;\n  --color-primary-300: #6ee7b7;\n  --color-primary-400: #34d399;\n  --color-primary-500: #10b981;\n  --color-primary-600: #059669;\n  --color-primary-700: #047857;\n  --color-primary-800: #065f46;\n  --color-primary-900: #064e3b;\n\n  /* Secondary Colors (Neutral) */\n  --color-secondary-50: #f8fafc;\n  --color-secondary-100: #f1f5f9;\n  --color-secondary-200: #e2e8f0;\n  --color-secondary-300: #cbd5e1;\n  --color-secondary-400: #94a3b8;\n  --color-secondary-500: #64748b;\n  --color-secondary-600: #475569;\n  --color-secondary-700: #334155;\n  --color-secondary-800: #1e293b;\n  --color-secondary-900: #0f172a;\n\n  /* Slate Colors */\n  --color-slate-50: #f8fafc;\n  --color-slate-100: #f1f5f9;\n  --color-slate-200: #e2e8f0;\n  --color-slate-300: #cbd5e1;\n  --color-slate-400: #94a3b8;\n  --color-slate-500: #64748b;\n  --color-slate-600: #475569;\n  --color-slate-700: #334155;\n  --color-slate-800: #1e293b;\n  --color-slate-900: #0f172a;\n\n  /* Accent Colors (Blue) */\n  --color-accent-50: #eff6ff;\n  --color-accent-100: #dbeafe;\n  --color-accent-200: #bfdbfe;\n  --color-accent-300: #93c5fd;\n  --color-accent-400: #60a5fa;\n  --color-accent-500: #3b82f6;\n  --color-accent-600: #2563eb;\n  --color-accent-700: #1d4ed8;\n  --color-accent-800: #1e40af;\n  --color-accent-900: #1e3a8a;\n\n  /* Semantic Colors */\n  --color-success-50: #ecfdf5;\n  --color-success-100: #d1fae5;\n  --color-success-500: #10b981;\n  --color-success-600: #059669;\n  --color-success-700: #047857;\n\n  --color-warning-50: #fffbeb;\n  --color-warning-100: #fef3c7;\n  --color-warning-500: #f59e0b;\n  --color-warning-600: #d97706;\n  --color-warning-700: #b45309;\n\n  --color-error-50: #fef2f2;\n  --color-error-100: #fee2e2;\n  --color-error-500: #ef4444;\n  --color-error-600: #dc2626;\n  --color-error-700: #b91c1c;\n\n  --color-info-50: #eff6ff;\n  --color-info-100: #dbeafe;\n  --color-info-500: #3b82f6;\n  --color-info-600: #2563eb;\n  --color-info-700: #1d4ed8;\n\n  /* Application-specific color mappings — Light mode default (aligned with design-system.css) */\n  --color-background-primary: #f8fafc;\n  --color-background-secondary: #ffffff;\n  --color-background-tertiary: #f1f5f9;\n  --color-background-inverse: #0f172a;\n\n  --color-text-primary: #111827;\n  --color-text-secondary: #4b5563;\n  --color-text-tertiary: #6b7280;\n  --color-text-inverse: #f8fafc;\n  --color-text-muted: #6b7280;      /* Upgraded from #9ca3af for WCAG AA 4.5:1 ✅ */\n  --color-text-disabled: #9ca3af;    /* Upgraded from #d1d5db for 3:1 non-text contrast ✅ */\n  --color-text-placeholder: #6b7280; /* gray-500: WCAG AA 4.5:1 ✅ */\n\n  --color-border-primary: #e5e7eb;\n  --color-border-secondary: #d1d5db;\n  --color-border-focus: #10b981;\n  --color-border-error: #ef4444;\n  --color-border-success: #10b981;\n\n  /* Status colors */\n  --color-status-online: #10b981;\n  --color-status-offline: #64748b;\n  --color-status-pending: #f59e0b;\n  --color-status-error: #ef4444;\n  --color-status-info: #3b82f6;\n\n  /* Spacing Scale (4px base unit) */\n  --spacing-0: 0px;\n  --spacing-px: 1px;\n  --spacing-0-5: 2px;\n  --spacing-1: 4px;\n  --spacing-1-5: 6px;\n  --spacing-2: 8px;\n  --spacing-2-5: 10px;\n  --spacing-3: 12px;\n  --spacing-3-5: 14px;\n  --spacing-4: 16px;\n  --spacing-5: 20px;\n  --spacing-6: 24px;\n  --spacing-7: 28px;\n  --spacing-8: 32px;\n  --spacing-9: 36px;\n  --spacing-10: 40px;\n  --spacing-11: 44px;\n  --spacing-12: 48px;\n  --spacing-14: 56px;\n  --spacing-16: 64px;\n  --spacing-20: 80px;\n  --spacing-24: 96px;\n  --spacing-28: 112px;\n  --spacing-32: 128px;\n  --spacing-36: 144px;\n  --spacing-40: 160px;\n  --spacing-44: 176px;\n  --spacing-48: 192px;\n  --spacing-52: 208px;\n  --spacing-56: 224px;\n  --spacing-60: 240px;\n  --spacing-64: 256px;\n  --spacing-72: 288px;\n  --spacing-80: 320px;\n  --spacing-96: 384px;\n\n  /* Typography */\n  --text-xs: 0.75rem;\n  --text-sm: 0.875rem;\n  --text-base: 1rem;\n  --text-lg: 1.125rem;\n  --text-xl: 1.25rem;\n  --text-2xl: 1.5rem;\n  --text-3xl: 1.875rem;\n  --text-4xl: 2.25rem;\n  --text-5xl: 3rem;\n  --text-6xl: 3.75rem;\n\n  /* Border Radius */\n  --radius-none: 0px;\n  --radius-sm: 4px;\n  --radius-md: 8px;\n  --radius-lg: 12px;\n  --radius-xl: 16px;\n  --radius-2xl: 20px;\n  --radius-3xl: 24px;\n  --radius-full: 9999px;\n\n  /* Shadows */\n  --shadow-none: none;\n  --shadow-xs: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 1px 2px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);\n  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);\n  --shadow-xl: 0 20px 25px -5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 8px 10px -6px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);\n  --shadow-2xl: 0 25px 50px -12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25);\n  --shadow-inner: inset 0 2px 4px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);\n\n  /* Transitions */\n  --transition-fast: 150ms;\n  --transition-normal: 200ms;\n  --transition-slow: 300ms;\n  --transition-slower: 500ms;\n\n  --ease-linear: linear;\n  --ease-in: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1);\n  --ease-out: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1);\n  --ease-in-out: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n  --ease-bounce-in: cubic-bezier(0.68, -0.55, 0.265, 1.55);\n  --ease-bounce-out: cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);\n\n  /* Z-Index Scale */\n  --z-hide: -1;\n  --z-auto: auto;\n  --z-base: 0;\n  --z-docked: 10;\n  --z-dropdown: 1000;\n  --z-sticky: 1100;\n  --z-banner: 1200;\n  --z-overlay: 1300;\n  --z-modal: 1400;\n  --z-popover: 1500;\n  --z-skip-link: 1600;\n  --z-toast: 1700;\n  --z-tooltip: 1800;\n\n  /* Breakpoints */\n  --breakpoint-xs: 0px;\n  --breakpoint-sm: 640px;\n  --breakpoint-md: 768px;\n  --breakpoint-lg: 1024px;\n  --breakpoint-xl: 1280px;\n  --breakpoint-2xl: 1536px;\n}\n\n/* Dark theme — supports both [data-theme=\"dark\"] and .dark for Tailwind compatibility */\n[data-theme=\"dark\"],\n.dark {\n  /* Override application-specific text/bg colors for dark mode */\n  --color-background-primary: #0f172a;\n  --color-background-secondary: #1e293b;\n  --color-background-tertiary: #334155;\n  --color-background-inverse: #f8fafc;\n\n  --color-text-primary: #f8fafc;\n  --color-text-secondary: #cbd5e1;\n  --color-text-tertiary: #94a3b8;\n  --color-text-inverse: #0f172a;\n  --color-text-muted: #94a3b8;      /* Upgraded from #cbd5e1 → slate-400: 5.6:1 ✅ */\n  --color-text-disabled: #64748b;    /* Upgraded: slate-500: 3.5:1 for non-text ✅ */\n  --color-text-placeholder: #94a3b8; /* slate-400: 5.6:1 on slate-900 ✅ */\n\n  --color-border-primary: #334155;\n  --color-border-secondary: #475569;\n\n  /* Component-specific dark colors */\n  --color-card-bg: #1e293b;\n  --color-card-border: #334155;\n  --color-input-bg: #1e293b;\n  --color-input-border: #475569;\n  --color-input-placeholder: #64748b;\n  --color-button-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  --color-overlay: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n  --color-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  \n  /* Component-specific dark colors */\n  --color-sidebar-bg: #0f172a;\n  --color-sidebar-item-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n  --color-sidebar-item-active: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);\n  --color-table-header: #1e293b;\n  --color-table-row-odd: #1e293b;\n  --color-table-row-even: #0f172a;\n  --color-table-row-hover: #334155;\n  --color-modal-bg: #1e293b;\n  --color-dropdown-bg: #1e293b;\n  --color-dropdown-hover: #334155;\n  --color-badge-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  --color-skeleton: #334155;\n  --color-skeleton-shimmer: #475569;\n  /* Note: --color-text-muted already set to #94a3b8 (slate-400: 5.6:1 ✅) above */\n}\n\n/* Light theme — explicit overrides for theme switching */\n[data-theme=\"light\"] {\n  --color-background-primary: #f8fafc;\n  --color-background-secondary: #ffffff;\n  --color-background-tertiary: #f1f5f9;\n  --color-background-inverse: #0f172a;\n\n  --color-text-primary: #111827;\n  --color-text-secondary: #4b5563;\n  --color-text-tertiary: #6b7280;\n  --color-text-inverse: #f8fafc;\n  --color-text-muted: #6b7280;      /* gray-500: 4.5:1 ✅ (upgraded from gray-400) */\n  --color-text-disabled: #9ca3af;    /* gray-400: 3:1 for large text/non-text ✅ */\n\n  --color-border-primary: #e5e7eb;\n  --color-border-secondary: #d1d5db;\n  --color-border-focus: #10b981;\n  --color-border-error: #ef4444;\n  --color-border-success: #10b981;\n  \n  /* Light mode specific component colors */\n  --color-card-bg: #ffffff;\n  --color-card-border: #e2e8f0;\n  --color-input-bg: #ffffff;\n  --color-input-border: #d1d5db;\n  --color-input-placeholder: #6b7280; /* gray-500: 4.5:1 ✅ */\n  --color-button-hover: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n  --color-overlay: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  --color-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n  \n  /* Component-specific light colors */\n  --color-sidebar-bg: #ffffff;\n  --color-sidebar-item-hover: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n  --color-sidebar-item-active: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);\n  --color-table-header: #f8fafc;\n  --color-table-row-odd: #ffffff;\n  --color-table-row-even: #f8fafc;\n  --color-table-row-hover: #f1f5f9;\n  --color-modal-bg: #ffffff;\n  --color-dropdown-bg: #ffffff;\n  --color-dropdown-hover: #f3f4f6;\n  --color-badge-bg: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n  --color-skeleton: #e2e8f0;\n  --color-skeleton-shimmer: #f1f5f9;\n}\n\n/* Theme transition - smooth color changes when switching themes */\nhtml,\nbody,\n.app-container,\n.sidebar,\n.main-content,\n.card,\n.modal,\n.dropdown,\n.input,\n.button,\n[class*=\"bg-\"],\n[class*=\"text-\"],\n[class*=\"border-\"] {\n  transition: \n    background-color var(--transition-normal) var(--ease-out),\n    border-color var(--transition-normal) var(--ease-out),\n    color var(--transition-fast) var(--ease-out),\n    box-shadow var(--transition-normal) var(--ease-out);\n}\n\n/* Reduced motion support */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  :root {\n    --transition-fast: 0ms;\n    --transition-normal: 0ms;\n    --transition-slow: 0ms;\n    --transition-slower: 0ms;\n  }\n  \n  *,\n  *::before,\n  *::after {\n    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Focus styles for accessibility */\n.focus-ring:focus {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--color-border-focus);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Touch target utilities */\n.touch-target {\n  min-height: 44px;\n  min-width: 44px;\n}\n\n/* Screen reader only content */\n.sr-only {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: -1px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border: 0;\n}\n\n/* Scrollbar styling */\n.scrollbar-hide {\n  -ms-overflow-style: none; /* IE and Edge */\n  overflow: -moz-scrollbars-none; /* Older Firefox fallback */\n}\n\n@supports (scrollbar-width: none) {\n  .scrollbar-hide {\n    scrollbar-width: none; /* Firefox 64+ */\n  }\n}\n\n.scrollbar-hide::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  display: none; /* Chrome, Safari, Edge */\n}\n\n/* Text balance utility */\n.text-balance {\n  overflow-wrap: break-word; /* Fallback for older browsers */\n}\n\n@supports (text-wrap: balance) {\n  .text-balance {\n    text-wrap: balance;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Container utilities */\n.container-app {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 var(--spacing-4);\n}\n\n/* Grid utilities */\n.grid-responsive {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n  gap: var(--spacing-4);\n}\n\n/* Animation keyframes */\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes slideIn {\n  from {\n    transform: translateY(-10px);\n    opacity: 0;\n  }\n  to {\n    transform: translateY(0);\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes scaleIn {\n  from {\n    transform: scale(0.95);\n    opacity: 0;\n  }\n  to {\n    transform: scale(1);\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Animation utility classes */\n.animate-fade-in {\n  animation: fadeIn var(--transition-normal) var(--ease-out);\n}\n\n.animate-slide-in {\n  animation: slideIn var(--transition-normal) var(--ease-out);\n}\n\n.animate-scale-in {\n  animation: scaleIn var(--transition-fast) var(--ease-out);\n}\n\n\n\n\n\n/*# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;base64, */"],["STYLE",{},"/**\n * WCAG 2.1 AA Compliance Styles\n * \n * Comprehensive accessibility styles for keyboard navigation,\n * screen reader support, high contrast themes, and text scaling\n */\n\n/* ===== ROOT VARIABLES ===== */\n:root {\n  /* Text scaling support */\n  --text-scale-factor: 1;\n  --base-font-size: 16px;\n  \n  /* Focus indicators */\n  --focus-outline-width: 2px;\n  --focus-outline-color: #3b82f6;\n  --focus-outline-offset: 2px;\n  \n  /* Touch targets */\n  --min-touch-target: 44px;\n  --min-touch-target-mobile: 48px;\n  \n  /* Color contrast ratios (WCAG AA compliant) */\n  --contrast-ratio-normal: 4.5;\n  --contrast-ratio-large: 3;\n  \n  /* Animation durations */\n  --animation-duration-fast: 0.15s;\n  --animation-duration-normal: 0.3s;\n  --animation-duration-slow: 0.5s;\n}\n\n/* ===== TEXT SCALING SUPPORT ===== */\nhtml {\n  font-size: calc(var(--base-font-size) * var(--text-scale-factor));\n}\n\n/* Ensure text can scale up to 200% without horizontal scrolling */\n@media (min-width: 1280px) {\n  .text-scale-container {\n    max-width: 100vw;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Text scaling classes */\n.text-scale-100 { --text-scale-factor: 1; }\n.text-scale-110 { --text-scale-factor: 1.1; }\n.text-scale-120 { --text-scale-factor: 1.2; }\n.text-scale-130 { --text-scale-factor: 1.3; }\n.text-scale-140 { --text-scale-factor: 1.4; }\n.text-scale-150 { --text-scale-factor: 1.5; }\n.text-scale-160 { --text-scale-factor: 1.6; }\n.text-scale-170 { --text-scale-factor: 1.7; }\n.text-scale-180 { --text-scale-factor: 1.8; }\n.text-scale-190 { --text-scale-factor: 1.9; }\n.text-scale-200 { --text-scale-factor: 2; }\n\n/* ===== KEYBOARD NAVIGATION ===== */\n\n/* Enhanced focus indicators */\n*:focus {\n  outline: var(--focus-outline-width) solid var(--focus-outline-color);\n  outline-offset: var(--focus-outline-offset);\n}\n\n/* Focus-visible for modern browsers */\n*:focus-visible {\n  outline: var(--focus-outline-width) solid var(--focus-outline-color);\n  outline-offset: var(--focus-outline-offset);\n}\n\n/* Remove focus outline for mouse users */\n*:focus:not(:focus-visible) {\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n/* Enhanced focus for interactive elements */\nbutton:focus-visible,\na:focus-visible,\ninput:focus-visible,\nselect:focus-visible,\ntextarea:focus-visible,\n[role=\"button\"]:focus-visible,\n[role=\"link\"]:focus-visible,\n[role=\"menuitem\"]:focus-visible,\n[role=\"tab\"]:focus-visible,\n[tabindex]:focus-visible {\n  outline: var(--focus-outline-width) solid var(--focus-outline-color);\n  outline-offset: var(--focus-outline-offset);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);\n}\n\n/* Keyboard navigation class for enhanced focus */\n.keyboard-navigation *:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus-outline-color);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);\n}\n\n/* Focus indicators class */\n.focus-indicators *:focus-visible {\n  outline: 4px solid var(--focus-outline-color);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);\n}\n\n/* ===== TOUCH TARGETS ===== */\n\n/* Minimum touch target sizes */\nbutton,\na,\ninput[type=\"button\"],\ninput[type=\"submit\"],\ninput[type=\"reset\"],\ninput[type=\"checkbox\"],\ninput[type=\"radio\"],\nselect,\n[role=\"button\"],\n[role=\"link\"],\n[role=\"menuitem\"],\n[role=\"tab\"],\n[tabindex]:not([tabindex=\"-1\"]) {\n  min-width: var(--min-touch-target);\n  min-height: var(--min-touch-target);\n}\n\n/* Mobile touch targets */\n@media (hover: none) and (pointer: coarse) {\n  button,\n  a,\n  input[type=\"button\"],\n  input[type=\"submit\"],\n  input[type=\"reset\"],\n  input[type=\"checkbox\"],\n  input[type=\"radio\"],\n  select,\n  [role=\"button\"],\n  [role=\"link\"],\n  [role=\"menuitem\"],\n  [role=\"tab\"],\n  [tabindex]:not([tabindex=\"-1\"]) {\n    min-width: var(--min-touch-target-mobile);\n    min-height: var(--min-touch-target-mobile);\n  }\n}\n\n/* ===== HIGH CONTRAST THEMES ===== */\n\n/* High contrast mode detection */\n@media (prefers-contrast: high) {\n  :root {\n    --color-background: #ffffff;\n    --color-foreground: #000000;\n    --color-border: #000000;\n    --color-primary: #0000ff;\n    --color-secondary: #666666;\n    --color-success: #008000;\n    --color-warning: #ff8c00;\n    --color-error: #ff0000;\n    --color-info: #0000ff;\n    --focus-outline-color: #000000;\n  }\n  \n  /* Enhanced borders for high contrast */\n  button,\n  input,\n  select,\n  textarea,\n  .card,\n  .modal,\n  .dropdown {\n    border: 2px solid #000000 !important;\n  }\n  \n  /* Enhanced focus indicators */\n  *:focus-visible {\n    outline: 3px solid #000000 !important;\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n    background-color: #ffff00 !important;\n    color: #000000 !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* High contrast theme class */\n.high-contrast {\n  --color-background: #ffffff !important;\n  --color-foreground: #000000 !important;\n  --color-border: #000000 !important;\n  --color-primary: #0000ff !important;\n  --color-secondary: #666666 !important;\n  --color-success: #008000 !important;\n  --color-warning: #ff8c00 !important;\n  --color-error: #ff0000 !important;\n  --color-info: #0000ff !important;\n  --focus-outline-color: #000000 !important;\n}\n\n.high-contrast * {\n  background-color: var(--color-background) !important;\n  color: var(--color-foreground) !important;\n  border-color: var(--color-border) !important;\n}\n\n.high-contrast button,\n.high-contrast input,\n.high-contrast select,\n.high-contrast textarea {\n  border: 2px solid var(--color-border) !important;\n  background-color: var(--color-background) !important;\n  color: var(--color-foreground) !important;\n}\n\n.high-contrast button:hover,\n.high-contrast button:focus {\n  background-color: var(--color-primary) !important;\n  color: #ffffff !important;\n}\n\n.high-contrast *:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--color-border) !important;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n  background-color: #ffff00 !important;\n  color: #000000 !important;\n}\n\n/* Dark high contrast theme */\n.high-contrast-dark {\n  --color-background: #000000 !important;\n  --color-foreground: #ffffff !important;\n  --color-border: #ffffff !important;\n  --color-primary: #00ffff !important;\n  --color-secondary: #cccccc !important;\n  --color-success: #00ff00 !important;\n  --color-warning: #ffff00 !important;\n  --color-error: #ff0000 !important;\n  --color-info: #00ffff !important;\n  --focus-outline-color: #ffffff !important;\n}\n\n/* ===== REDUCED MOTION ===== */\n\n/* Respect user's motion preferences */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  *,\n  *::before,\n  *::after {\n    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Reduced motion class */\n.reduced-motion *,\n.reduced-motion *::before,\n.reduced-motion *::after {\n  animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n  animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n  transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n  scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n}\n\n/* ===== SCREEN READER SUPPORT ===== */\n\n/* Screen reader only content */\n.sr-only {\n  position: absolute !important;\n  width: 1px !important;\n  height: 1px !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  margin: -1px !important;\n  overflow: hidden !important;\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0) !important;\n  white-space: nowrap !important;\n  border: 0 !important;\n}\n\n/* Screen reader only focusable */\n.sr-only-focusable:focus {\n  position: static !important;\n  width: auto !important;\n  height: auto !important;\n  padding: inherit !important;\n  margin: inherit !important;\n  overflow: visible !important;\n  clip: auto !important;\n  white-space: normal !important;\n}\n\n/* Live regions for announcements */\n.live-region {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: -10000px;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* ===== FORM ACCESSIBILITY ===== */\n\n/* Enhanced form labels */\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  color: var(--color-foreground);\n}\n\n/* Required field indicators */\n.required::after {\n  content: \" *\";\n  color: var(--color-error, #ef4444);\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n/* Form validation states */\n.form-field {\n  position: relative;\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.form-field input:invalid,\n.form-field select:invalid,\n.form-field textarea:invalid {\n  border-color: var(--color-error, #ef4444);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);\n}\n\n.form-field input:valid,\n.form-field select:valid,\n.form-field textarea:valid {\n  border-color: var(--color-success, #10b981);\n}\n\n/* Error messages */\n.error-message {\n  color: var(--color-error, #ef4444);\n  font-size: 0.875rem;\n  margin-top: 0.25rem;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.error-message::before {\n  content: \"⚠\";\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n/* Success messages */\n.success-message {\n  color: var(--color-success, #10b981);\n  font-size: 0.875rem;\n  margin-top: 0.25rem;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.success-message::before {\n  content: \"✓\";\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n/* ===== MODAL ACCESSIBILITY ===== */\n\n/* Modal focus trap */\n.modal {\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  z-index: 1000;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\n.modal-content {\n  background: var(--color-background, #ffffff);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 2rem;\n  max-width: 90vw;\n  max-height: 90vh;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.modal-content:focus {\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n/* ===== SKIP LINKS ===== */\n\n/* Skip links are handled in SkipLinks.css */\n\n/* ===== KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS ===== */\n\n/* Keyboard shortcut indicators */\n.keyboard-shortcut {\n  font-family: monospace;\n  background-color: var(--color-muted, #f1f5f9);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  padding: 0.125rem 0.25rem;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n/* ===== RESPONSIVE ACCESSIBILITY ===== */\n\n/* Mobile accessibility improvements */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  /* Larger touch targets on mobile */\n  button,\n  a,\n  input,\n  select,\n  [role=\"button\"],\n  [tabindex]:not([tabindex=\"-1\"]) {\n    min-height: var(--min-touch-target-mobile);\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n  }\n  \n  /* Larger text for better readability */\n  body {\n    font-size: 1.125rem;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  \n  /* Enhanced focus indicators on mobile */\n  *:focus-visible {\n    outline-width: 3px;\n    outline-offset: 3px;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ===== PRINT ACCESSIBILITY ===== */\n\n@media print {\n  /* Ensure good contrast for printing */\n  * {\n    background: transparent !important;\n    color: black !important;\n    box-shadow: none !important;\n    text-shadow: none !important;\n  }\n  \n  /* Show URLs for links */\n  a[href]:after {\n    content: \" (\" attr(href) \")\";\n  }\n  \n  /* Hide interactive elements */\n  button,\n  input,\n  select,\n  textarea,\n  .modal,\n  .dropdown,\n  .tooltip {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ===== ANIMATION PREFERENCES ===== */\n\n/* Safe animations that respect motion preferences */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {\n  .fade-in {\n    animation: fadeIn var(--animation-duration-normal) ease-in-out;\n  }\n  \n  .slide-in {\n    animation: slideIn var(--animation-duration-normal) ease-out;\n  }\n  \n  .scale-in {\n    animation: scaleIn var(--animation-duration-fast) ease-out;\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from { opacity: 0; }\n  to { opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n@keyframes slideIn {\n  from { transform: translateY(-10px); opacity: 0; }\n  to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n@keyframes scaleIn {\n  from { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0; }\n  to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n/* ===== COLOR CONTRAST UTILITIES ===== */\n\n/* High contrast text utilities */\n.text-high-contrast {\n  color: var(--color-foreground) !important;\n  background-color: var(--color-background) !important;\n}\n\n.text-high-contrast-inverse {\n  color: var(--color-background) !important;\n  background-color: var(--color-foreground) !important;\n}\n\n/* ===== FOCUS MANAGEMENT ===== */\n\n/* Focus trap helper */\n.focus-trap {\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.focus-trap:focus {\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n/* Focus restoration */\n.focus-restore {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: -9999px;\n  top: -9999px;\n}\n\n/* ===== ARIA ENHANCEMENTS ===== */\n\n/* Visual indicators for ARIA states */\n[aria-expanded=\"true\"]::after {\n  /* content: \" (expanded)\"; Removed debug text */\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  color: var(--color-muted-foreground);\n}\n\n[aria-expanded=\"false\"]::after {\n  /* content: \" (collapsed)\"; Removed debug text */\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  color: var(--color-muted-foreground);\n}\n\n[aria-selected=\"true\"] {\n  background-color: var(--color-primary);\n  color: var(--color-primary-foreground);\n}\n\n[aria-current=\"page\"] {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\n/* ===== UTILITY CLASSES ===== */\n\n/* Accessibility utility classes */\n.a11y-hidden {\n  position: absolute !important;\n  width: 1px !important;\n  height: 1px !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  margin: -1px !important;\n  overflow: hidden !important;\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0) !important;\n  white-space: nowrap !important;\n  border: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.a11y-focusable:focus {\n  position: static !important;\n  width: auto !important;\n  height: auto !important;\n  padding: inherit !important;\n  margin: inherit !important;\n  overflow: visible !important;\n  clip: auto !important;\n  white-space: normal !important;\n}\n\n.a11y-skip-link {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -40px;\n  left: 6px;\n  background: var(--color-primary);\n  color: var(--color-primary-foreground);\n  padding: 8px 16px;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;\n  z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n.a11y-skip-link:focus {\n  top: 6px;\n}\n\n/* ===== BROWSER COMPATIBILITY ===== */\n\n/* Ensure compatibility with older browsers */\n@supports not (selector(:focus-visible)) {\n  /* Fallback for browsers without focus-visible support */\n  button:focus,\n  a:focus,\n  input:focus,\n  select:focus,\n  textarea:focus,\n  [tabindex]:focus {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--focus-outline-color);\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n}\n/*# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;base64, */"],["STYLE",{},"/* Browser compatibility styles for cross-browser support */\n\n/* =======================\n   Browser-specific fixes\n   ======================= */\n\n/* Safari fixes */\n.safari-vh-fix {\n  /* Fix for Safari's 100vh issue */\n  --vh: 1vh;\n}\n\n.safari-vh-fix .full-height {\n  height: calc(var(--vh, 1vh) * 100);\n}\n\n/* Firefox fixes */\n.firefox-flexbox-fix {\n  /* Fix for Firefox's flexbox min-height issue */\n  min-height: 0;\n}\n\n.firefox-flexbox-fix .flex-item {\n  min-height: 0;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n/* Chrome fixes */\n.chrome-scrollbar-fix {\n  /* Fix for Chrome's scrollbar styling */\n  scrollbar-width: thin;\n  scrollbar-color: #cbd5e1 #f1f5f9;\n}\n\n.chrome-scrollbar-fix::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 8px;\n  height: 8px;\n}\n\n.chrome-scrollbar-fix::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.chrome-scrollbar-fix::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: #cbd5e1;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.chrome-scrollbar-fix::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  background: #94a3b8;\n}\n\n/* Edge fixes */\n.edge-grid-fix {\n  /* Fix for Edge's CSS Grid issues */\n  display: grid;\n}\n\n.edge-grid-fix .grid-item {\n  grid-column: 1;\n  grid-row: 1;\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Feature detection classes\n   ======================= */\n\n/* CSS Grid support */\n.supports-grid .grid-container {\n  display: grid;\n}\n\n.no-grid .grid-container {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.no-grid .grid-item {\n  flex: 1 1 300px;\n  margin: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n/* CSS Flexbox support */\n.supports-flexbox .flex-container {\n  display: flex;\n}\n\n.no-flexbox .flex-container {\n  display: table;\n}\n\n.no-flexbox .flex-item {\n  display: table-cell;\n  vertical-align: top;\n}\n\n/* CSS Custom Properties support */\n.supports-custom-properties {\n  --primary-color: #3b82f6;\n  --secondary-color: #6b7280;\n  --success-color: #10b981;\n  --warning-color: #f59e0b;\n  --error-color: #ef4444;\n}\n\n.no-custom-properties {\n  /* Fallback colors for browsers without custom properties support */\n  --primary-color: #3b82f6;\n  --secondary-color: #6b7280;\n  --success-color: #10b981;\n  --warning-color: #f59e0b;\n  --error-color: #ef4444;\n}\n\n/* Touch support */\n.supports-touch .touch-target {\n  min-height: 44px;\n  min-width: 44px;\n}\n\n.no-touch .touch-target {\n  min-height: 32px;\n  min-width: 32px;\n}\n\n/* WebGL support */\n.supports-webgl .webgl-container {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.no-webgl .webgl-container {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.no-webgl .webgl-fallback {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* WebAssembly support */\n.supports-webassembly .wasm-module {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.no-webassembly .wasm-module {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.no-webassembly .wasm-fallback {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Performance classes\n   ======================= */\n\n/* High performance devices */\n.high-performance .heavy-animation {\n  animation-duration: 0.3s;\n  transition-duration: 0.3s;\n}\n\n.high-performance .complex-layout {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n  gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n/* Medium performance devices */\n.medium-performance .heavy-animation {\n  animation-duration: 0.5s;\n  transition-duration: 0.5s;\n}\n\n.medium-performance .complex-layout {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n.medium-performance .complex-layout > * {\n  flex: 1 1 300px;\n}\n\n/* Low performance devices */\n.low-performance .heavy-animation {\n  animation-duration: 0.8s;\n  transition-duration: 0.8s;\n}\n\n.low-performance .complex-layout {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.low-performance .complex-layout > * {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.low-performance .complex-layout > *:last-child {\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Memory classes\n   ======================= */\n\n/* High memory devices */\n.high-memory .lazy-load {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.high-memory .virtual-scroll {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* Medium memory devices */\n.medium-memory .lazy-load {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.medium-memory .virtual-scroll {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n/* Low memory devices */\n.low-memory .lazy-load {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.low-memory .virtual-scroll {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.low-memory .heavy-content {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Browser-specific overrides\n   ======================= */\n\n/* Internet Explorer */\n.browser-ie .modern-feature {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.browser-ie .ie-fallback {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.browser-ie .grid-container {\n  display: table;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.browser-ie .grid-item {\n  display: table-cell;\n  vertical-align: top;\n}\n\n/* Opera */\n.browser-opera .opera-specific {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Responsive design fixes\n   ======================= */\n\n/* Mobile Safari */\n@supports (-webkit-touch-callout: none) {\n  .mobile-safari .viewport-fix {\n    height: -webkit-fill-available;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Mobile Chrome */\n@supports (display: -webkit-box) {\n  .mobile-chrome .viewport-fix {\n    height: 100vh;\n  }\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Accessibility fixes\n   ======================= */\n\n/* High contrast mode */\n@media (prefers-contrast: high) {\n  .high-contrast .text-muted {\n    color: #000000;\n  }\n  \n  .high-contrast .border-subtle {\n    border-color: #000000;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Reduced motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .reduced-motion * {\n    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Print styles\n   ======================= */\n\n@media print {\n  .print-hidden {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n  \n  .print-visible {\n    display: block !important;\n  }\n  \n  .print-break {\n    page-break-before: always;\n  }\n  \n  .print-no-break {\n    page-break-inside: avoid;\n  }\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Dark mode support\n   ======================= */\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .dark-mode .bg-white {\n    background-color: #1f2937;\n  }\n  \n  .dark-mode .text-gray-900 {\n    color: #f9fafb;\n  }\n  \n  .dark-mode .text-gray-600 {\n    color: #d1d5db;\n  }\n  \n  .dark-mode .border-gray-200 {\n    border-color: #374151;\n  }\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Fallback styles\n   ======================= */\n\n/* Fallback for unsupported features */\n.no-support .feature-dependent {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.no-support .fallback-content {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* Graceful degradation */\n.degraded .enhanced-feature {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.degraded .basic-feature {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Utility classes\n   ======================= */\n\n/* Browser detection utilities */\n.browser-chrome .chrome-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.browser-firefox .firefox-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.browser-safari .safari-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.browser-edge .edge-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.browser-opera .opera-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* Feature detection utilities */\n.supports-grid .grid-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.supports-flexbox .flexbox-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.supports-custom-properties .custom-properties-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.supports-touch .touch-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.supports-webgl .webgl-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.supports-webassembly .webassembly-only {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* Performance utilities */\n.high-performance .performance-optimized {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.medium-performance .performance-optimized {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.low-performance .performance-optimized {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n/* Memory utilities */\n.high-memory .memory-intensive {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.medium-memory .memory-intensive {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.low-memory .memory-intensive {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n\n/*# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;base64, */"],["STYLE",{},"/* =======================\n   Design System Variables\n======================= */\n:root {\n  /* Brand Colors */\n  --color-brand-50: #ecfdf5;\n  --color-brand-100: #d1fae5;\n  --color-brand-200: #a7f3d0;\n  --color-brand-300: #6ee7b7;\n  --color-brand-400: #34d399;\n  --color-brand-500: #10b981;\n  --color-brand-600: #059669;\n  --color-brand-700: #047857;\n  --color-brand-800: #065f46;\n  --color-brand-900: #064e3b;\n\n  /* Neutral Colors */\n  --color-slate-50: #f8fafc;\n  --color-slate-100: #f1f5f9;\n  --color-slate-200: #e2e8f0;\n  --color-slate-300: #cbd5e1;\n  --color-slate-400: #94a3b8;\n  --color-slate-500: #64748b;\n  --color-slate-600: #475569;\n  --color-slate-700: #334155;\n  --color-slate-800: #1e293b;\n  --color-slate-900: #0f172a;\n\n  /* Semantic Colors */\n  --color-success: #10b981;\n  --color-warning: #f59e0b;\n  --color-error: #ef4444;\n  --color-info: #3b82f6;\n\n  /* Legacy theme variables for backward compatibility */\n  --bg: var(--color-slate-900);\n  --panel: var(--color-slate-800);\n  --muted: var(--color-slate-400);\n  --text: var(--color-slate-200);\n  --accent: var(--color-brand-500);\n  --danger: var(--color-error);\n  --line: var(--color-slate-700);\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Reset & Base\n======================= */\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nhtml,\nbody,\n#root {\n  height: 100%;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Custom Utilities (not available in Tailwind)\n======================= */\n\n/* Custom scrollbar styles */\n.custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 6px;\n  height: 6px;\n}\n\n.custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: var(--color-slate-800);\n  border-radius: 3px;\n}\n\n.custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: var(--color-slate-600);\n  border-radius: 3px;\n}\n\n.custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  background: var(--color-slate-500);\n}\n\n/* Custom gradient backgrounds */\n.gradient-bg {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);\n}\n\n.sidebar-gradient {\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #071022 0%, #081426 100%);\n}\n\n/* Custom focus styles for better accessibility */\n.focus-ring-custom:focus {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Custom animations */\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(10px);\n  }\n\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n.animate-fade-in {\n  animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n\n/* Custom scrollbar for specific components */\n.custom-scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 4px;\n  height: 4px;\n}\n\n.custom-scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: transparent;\n}\n\n.custom-scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: var(--color-slate-600);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n}\n\n.custom-scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  background: var(--color-slate-500);\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Accessibility\n======================= */\n.sr-only {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: -1px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border: 0;\n}\n\n.focus\\:not-sr-only:focus {\n  position: static;\n  width: auto;\n  height: auto;\n  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n  margin: 0;\n  overflow: visible;\n  clip: auto;\n  white-space: normal;\n}\n\n/* Focus indicators */\n*:focus {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:focus,\ninput:focus,\nselect:focus,\ntextarea:focus {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* =======================\n   Tailwind CSS Import\n======================= */\n/* Tailwind CSS imported in index.css */\n\n/* Import browser compatibility styles */\n/*# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;base64, */"],["STYLE",{},"/* Error Boundary Styles */\n.error-boundary {\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', 'Oxygen',\n    'Ubuntu', 'Cantarell', 'Fira Sans', 'Droid Sans', 'Helvetica Neue',\n    sans-serif;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n}\n\n/* Keyboard accessibility */\n.error-boundary:focus {\n  outline: 2px solid #3b82f6;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__keyboard-help {\n  font-size: 0.875rem;\n  color: #6b7280;\n  margin-top: 1rem;\n  padding: 0.75rem;\n  background: #f3f4f6;\n  border-radius: 0.5rem;\n  border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;\n}\n\n/* Page-level error boundary */\n.error-boundary--page {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__container {\n  max-width: 600px;\n  width: 100%;\n  background: white;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n  padding: 40px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Component-level error boundary */\n.error-boundary--component {\n  border: 2px dashed #e74c3c;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  margin: 10px 0;\n  background: #fdf2f2;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__icon {\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n}\n\n.error-boundary--component .error-boundary__icon {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__content {\n  max-width: 100%;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__title {\n  color: #2c3e50;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.error-boundary--component .error-boundary__title {\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__message {\n  color: #7f8c8d;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary--component .error-boundary__message {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__error-id {\n  background: #f8f9fa;\n  border: 1px solid #e9ecef;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  font-family: 'Monaco', 'Menlo', 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: #495057;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__error-id code {\n  background: #e9ecef;\n  padding: 2px 6px;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #e74c3c;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__retry-info {\n  background: #fff3cd;\n  border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: #856404;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__details {\n  margin: 20px 0;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__details summary {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #495057;\n  padding: 8px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n  display: block;\n  -webkit-user-select: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__details summary:focus {\n  outline: 2px solid #3b82f6;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__details summary:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid #3b82f6;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__details summary:active {\n  color: #007bff;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__details summary:focus:not(:focus-visible) {\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__details summary:focus-visible:not(:focus) {\n  outline: 2px solid #3b82f6;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__details summary:hover {\n  color: #007bff;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__error-text {\n  background: #f8f9fa;\n  border: 1px solid #e9ecef;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-family: 'Monaco', 'Menlo', 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: #495057;\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n  word-break: break-word;\n  max-height: 200px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__stack {\n  margin-top: 10px;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: #6c757d;\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n  word-break: break-word;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary--component .error-boundary__actions {\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button {\n  padding: 12px 24px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  min-width: 120px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button:focus {\n  outline: 2px solid #3b82f6;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid #3b82f6;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.6;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button--primary {\n  background: #007bff;\n  color: white;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button--primary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: #0056b3;\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.3);\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button--secondary {\n  background: #6c757d;\n  color: white;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button--secondary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: #545b62;\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(108, 117, 125, 0.3);\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button--outline {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: #007bff;\n  border: 2px solid #007bff;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button--outline:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: #007bff;\n  color: white;\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.3);\n}\n\n.error-boundary__help {\n  color: #6c757d;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__help p {\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* Responsive design */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .error-boundary--page {\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__container {\n    padding: 30px 20px;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__title {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__message {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__actions {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__button {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 200px;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  .error-boundary__container {\n    padding: 20px 15px;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__title {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__icon {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary--component .error-boundary__icon {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Dark mode support */\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .error-boundary--page {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50 0%, #34495e 100%);\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__container {\n    background: #2c3e50;\n    color: #ecf0f1;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__title {\n    color: #ecf0f1;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__message {\n    color: #bdc3c7;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__error-id {\n    background: #34495e;\n    border-color: #4a5f7a;\n    color: #ecf0f1;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__error-id code {\n    background: #4a5f7a;\n    color: #e74c3c;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__error-text {\n    background: #34495e;\n    border-color: #4a5f7a;\n    color: #ecf0f1;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__details summary {\n    color: #ecf0f1;\n    border-color: #4a5f7a;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary__help {\n    color: #bdc3c7;\n  }\n  \n  .error-boundary--component {\n    background: #2c3e50;\n    border-color: #e74c3c;\n    color: #ecf0f1;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Animation for retry button */\n@keyframes pulse {\n  0% {\n    transform: scale(1);\n  }\n  50% {\n    transform: scale(1.05);\n  }\n  100% {\n    transform: scale(1);\n  }\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button--primary:not(:disabled):active {\n  animation: pulse 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n/* Loading state for retry */\n.error-boundary__button:disabled {\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.error-boundary__button:disabled::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n  margin: auto;\n  border: 2px solid transparent;\n  border-top-color: currentColor;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  animation: spin 1s linear infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes spin {\n  0% {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  100% {\n    transform: rotate(360deg);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Class-based Dark Mode */\nhtml.dark .error-boundary--page {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50 0%, #34495e 100%);\n}\n\nhtml.dark .error-boundary__container {\n  background: #2c3e50;\n  color: #ecf0f1;\n}\n\nhtml.dark .error-boundary__title { color: #ecf0f1; }\nhtml.dark .error-boundary__message { color: #bdc3c7; }\n\nhtml.dark .error-boundary__error-id {\n  background: #34495e;\n  border-color: #4a5f7a;\n  color: #ecf0f1;\n}\n\nhtml.dark .error-boundary__error-id code {\n  background: #4a5f7a;\n  color: #e74c3c;\n}\n\nhtml.dark .error-boundary__error-text {\n  background: #3